{
    "background_story": "Legend was a majestic black stallion with a spirit as wild as the storms that swept across the open plains. Born during a fierce tempest, he was named after the turbulent weather that marked his arrival. As he grew, Legend became known for his fearlessness and agility, able to navigate the most treacherous terrain with ease. During a particularly violent storm, a group of riders became lost and disoriented. Legend, sensing their distress, broke free from his stable and galloped into the heart of the tempest. With his keen instincts, he guided the riders to safety, shielding them from the wind and rain with his powerful body. From that day on, Legend was hailed as a hero, his name becoming synonymous with bravery and strength in the face of adversity.",
